    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66741" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετα-κῠλίνδω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roll to another place, roll over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετακυλίνδειν αὑτὸν ἀεὶ πρὸς τὸν εὖ
					πράττοντα τοῖχον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					536
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετα-κῠλίω</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, Paul. Aeg.<i><span class="en">
				6.74
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἕτερα πάθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.535
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
			</span></i>
			<i>in de An.</i><i><span class="en">
				115.2
			</span></i>.</div>
